{"id":"wb-8-361","name":"杞县大云寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"杞縣大雲寺塔","text":"杞县大云寺塔，又称瓦岗塔、瓦岗寺塔，位于中国河南省开封市杞县宗店乡瓦岗村东北部的大云寺旧址，距杞县县城约25公里。塔始建于唐朝，现存塔体重建于明朝万历年间，为八角七级楼阁式砖塔。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%9E%E7%B8%A3%E5%A4%A7%E9%9B%B2%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":95376013,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95376013","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0d1a33c52d75e59a50143d59.jpg","title":"20240806_Pagoda_of_Dayun_Temple_in_Qixian_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240806_Pagoda_of_Dayun_Temple_in_Qixian_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/20240806_Pagoda_of_Dayun_Temple_in_Qixian_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​杞县大云寺塔，第八批全国重点文物保护单位","width":320,"height":480}}